 "description": "Make every day a weekend. The Aquila 32 Sport power catamaran answers the horizon's call with nimble performance and dayboating intelligence wrapped in a perfectly sized package.\nTwin Mercury Verado V6 225HP engines (upgradable to 300HP with joystick piloting) provide responsive handling with catamaran stability, creating an exceptionally smooth ride even when conditions turn challenging. The efficient hull design stretches your range to distant coves while the versatile deck layout—wide enough to host 22 passengers—transforms to match your mood.\nWhen adventure extends beyond sunset, the appointed cabin with memory foam mattress and private bathroom offers comfortable overnight accommodation—a rarity in this size class. Smart details like the extended swim platform, integrated coolers, and multiple storage solutions ensure nothing interrupts your enjoyment.\nFor those who understand that life's best moments often arrive unexpectedly, the Aquila 32 Sport stands ready.\nBecause out there, thrills abound.",
